                <invention-title lang="de">ANORDNUNGEN ZUR BEFESTIGUNG EINES LADUNGSTRÄGERS AN EINEM LADUNGSTRÄGER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">AGENCEMENTS POUR FIXER UN PORTE-CHARGES À UN PORTE-CHARGES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ARRANGEMENTS FOR FIXING A CARGO CARRIER TO A LOAD CARRIER</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed are configurations for securing an accessory to a load carrier. The configurations comprise an adapter or a quick-lock fixation unit. The accessory may be a cargo carrier, for example a load receptacle. The load carrier can be a bike carrier. The adapter is configured to convert a portion of the load carrier, for example a wheel tray portion of a bike carrier, into a supporting portion for the accessory. The adapter may act as an interface between the wheel tray portion and the cargo carrier.</p>
            </abstract>
